WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.400
-Guys, I always say our show

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.200
is lucky to have
the greatest band in late night,

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.767
The Roots right there,
ladies and gentlemen.

00:00:06.767 --> 00:00:09.167
[ Cheers and applause ]
There. I always say that.

00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:11.601
I always say that.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:00:11.601 --> 00:00:13.801
-But it isn't always
fun and games.

00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:16.100
From time to time,
we put The Roots to the test.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.200
We're gonna pick three people
from our audience tonight

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.901
and have The Roots make up songs
about them on the spot.

00:00:20.901 --> 00:00:24.133
It's time for
"Freestylin' with The Roots."

00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:33.467
♪ Time to freestyle
with The Roots ♪

00:00:33.467 --> 00:00:34.934
-Roots, you guys ready
to do this?

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:36.367
You guys psyched?
Oh, I love it.

00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:38.434
All right, let's pick someone.
Raise your hand if you want

00:00:38.434 --> 00:00:40.634
The Roots to make up a song
about you right here.

00:00:40.634 --> 00:00:42.100
[ Cheering ]

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:44.767
Right there in the white
sweater, in the white.

00:00:44.767 --> 00:00:46.534
Yeah, yeah.
Yeah, right there.

00:00:46.534 --> 00:00:47.534
There you go.
-What is your name...

00:00:47.534 --> 00:00:48.934
-Hi.
-...and where are you from?

00:00:48.934 --> 00:00:51.467
-I'm from France,
and my name is Ninon.

00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:54.200
-Oh.
[ Applause ]

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.033
I love it.
Your name is Ninon?

00:00:56.033 --> 00:00:58.801
-Yes, N-I-N-O-N.
That's a lot of N.

00:00:58.801 --> 00:01:00.934
-Ninon from France.
Welcome.

00:01:00.934 --> 00:01:02.133
Thank you so much
for being here.

00:01:02.133 --> 00:01:04.133
-Thank you.
-The new season of

00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:07.334
"The Bachelor" starts next week
here in America.

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:09.267
What is -- What's the most
romantic thing

00:01:09.267 --> 00:01:11.234
