00:01:11.234 --> 00:01:12.834
-Mm.

00:01:12.834 --> 00:01:14.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.367 --> 00:01:16.834
I think France is very romantic.

00:01:16.834 --> 00:01:19.400
-Yeah, it is.
I think, like, a dinner,

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:21.100
nice dinner
in a nice restaurant,

00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:23.467
you know,
in the Paris atmosphere.

00:01:23.467 --> 00:01:25.067
You know how it feels?
-Love that.

00:01:25.067 --> 00:01:27.100
That is absolutely romantic.
I love it.

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:29.234
A nice dinner,
nice atmosphere.

00:01:29.234 --> 00:01:31.801
What is an instant turnoff
for you?

00:01:31.801 --> 00:01:35.367
-Oh, um...
The way people eat.

00:01:35.367 --> 00:01:38.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.334 --> 00:01:40.567
You know the noise
when people are eating like...

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:42.067
[ Smacking lips ]
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:44.534
-All right.
Yeah, okay, okay.

00:01:44.534 --> 00:01:47.300
-No, thank you.
-Yeah. The noise -- the way --

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:50.234
[ Laughter ]
-He took you out to

00:01:50.234 --> 00:01:52.367
a nice dinner, and then he's
like -- [ Smacking lips ]

00:01:52.367 --> 00:01:54.367
The whole thing was a disaster.
-It started well.

00:01:54.367 --> 00:01:56.200
-Yes.
All right, Ninon.

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:57.801
The way people eat.

00:01:57.801 --> 00:02:01.067
Roots, we have our pal Ninon
here from France.

00:02:01.067 --> 00:02:04.567
The most romantic thing anyone's
ever done for her is,

00:02:04.567 --> 00:02:07.467
they took her to a nice dinner
in a nice Paris atmosphere.

00:02:07.467 --> 00:02:09.567
Gorgeous, beautiful.
France is gorgeous.

00:02:09.567 --> 00:02:12.100
The instant turnoff
is the way people eat.

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:16.267
Sometimes they smack when they
eat their food, mouth open.

00:02:16.267 --> 00:02:18.767
No -- turnoff.
No, thanks.

00:02:18.767 --> 00:02:20.834
For this, our pal Miley Cyrus

00:02:20.834 --> 00:02:22.868
has the number-one song
in the country.

00:02:22.868 --> 00:02:25.734
We love you, Miley.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:25.734 --> 00:02:32.434
Can we do, like, a "Flowers"
type of thing with that vibe?

00:02:32.434 --> 00:02:41.367
♪♪

00:02:41.367 --> 00:02:43.334
-♪ Ninon from France ♪

00:02:43.334 --> 00:02:45.467
♪ Thank you for coming through ♪

00:02:45.467 --> 00:02:50.200
♪ Dinner in a Paris atmosphere's
a romantic thing to do ♪

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:54.367
♪ The way people eat noisy
turns you off, yeah, me too ♪

00:02:54.367 --> 00:02:59.334
